<header class="site-header">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a class="wordmark" href="./" aria-label="OPDHub home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>OPD<span>Hub</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Project links">
      <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.00626" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the survey <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="https://github.com/nick7nlp/Awesome-LLM-On-Policy-Distillation" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<main class="container">
  <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A research companion</p>
      <h1 id="page-title">On-policy distillation.<br><span>Connected perspectives.</span></h1>
      <p class="intro-description">How students learn from teachers on their own trajectories.<br class="desktop-break"> Explore the objectives, supervision, and systems behind the methods.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="survey-note" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.00626" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span class="note-label">Start with the survey <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      <span class="note-title">A map of the field,<br>one question at a time.</span>
      <span class="note-detail">Foundations · Methods · Open problems</span>
    </a>
  </section>
  <nav class="reading-paths" aria-label="Reading paths">
    <a href="#topic-4"><span class="path-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span><strong>Understand the learning signal</strong><span class="path-detail">Objectives, supervision &amp; training</span></span><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a href="#topic-7"><span class="path-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span><strong>Follow the agent into interaction</strong><span class="path-detail">Agents, tools &amp; applications</span></span><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a href="#topic-8"><span class="path-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span><strong>Examine what transfers</strong><span class="path-detail">Analysis, evaluation &amp; foundations</span></span><span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </nav>
  <div class="library-layout">
    <aside class="topic-sidebar" aria-label="Browse by topic">
      <div class="sidebar-inner">
        <p class="sidebar-label">The collection</p>
        <nav class="topic-nav" aria-label="Paper topics">{{TOPIC_NAV}}</nav>
        <p class="sidebar-note">Read across topics.<br>Compare the signal, the rollout,<br>and the update.</p>
        <a class="sidebar-link" href="https://github.com/nick7nlp/Awesome-LLM-On-Policy-Distillation/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Suggest a paper <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <section class="library-content" aria-label="Research papers">
      <div class="search-tools js-only">
        <div class="search-wrap">
          <svg class="search-icon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="m15.5 15.5 4.5 4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <label class="sr-only" for="search-input">Search title, author, method, or paper ID</label>
          <input id="search-input" type="search" placeholder="Search title, author, method, or paper ID" autocomplete="off">
          <kbd class="search-shortcut" aria-hidden="true">/</kbd>
        </div>
        <div class="search-toolbar">
          <span id="visible-count" class="search-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">{{PAPER_COUNT}} papers</span>
          <div class="search-actions">
            <button id="clear-filters" type="button" class="clear-btn">Reset</button>
            <button id="export-bibtex" type="button" class="export-btn">Export BibTeX <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <details class="filter-panel">
          <summary><span>Refine results</span><span class="filter-summary-detail">Mechanism &amp; year</span></summary>
          <div class="filter-grid">
            <div class="filter-row"><span class="filter-label">Mechanism</span><div class="filter-chips" data-filter-group="mechanism">{{FILTER_MECHANISMS}}</div></div>
            <div class="filter-row"><span class="filter-label">Year</span><div class="filter-chips" data-filter-group="year">{{FILTER_YEARS}}</div></div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
      <noscript><p class="static-note">Browse all {{PAPER_COUNT}} papers below. Enable JavaScript to search, filter, and export citations.</p></noscript>
      <p class="list-order">Newest first within each topic</p>
      <div id="paper-list" tabindex="-1">{{PAPER_LIST}}</div>
      <div id="empty-state" class="empty-state is-hidden"><span class="empty-symbol" aria-hidden="true">∅</span><h2>No matching papers</h2><p>Try another search or reset the filters.</p></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner"><span>OPDHub <span class="footer-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span> A reading companion for on-policy distillation</span><span><a href="https://github.com/eliahuhorwitz/Academic-project-page-template" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Credits</a><span class="footer-separator" aria-hidden="true">·</span><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-SA 4.0</a></span></div>
</footer>
<div id="copy-status" class="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
